{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-betti-numbers-brane","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:betti-numbers-brane","kind":"remark","title":"Betti numbers of the brane tower","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quantum-characteristic-classes"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quantum-characteristic-classes","tags":["betti-numbers","brane-tower","spectral-sequence"],"text":"betti-numbers-brane.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:betti-numbers-brane\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b_k(\\mathcal{S}_n) = \\dim H^k(\\mathcal{S}_n, \\mathbb{R})</code> denote the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k</code>-th Betti number of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{S}_n</code>. Since <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{S}_{n+1}</code> is the bundle of orthonormal frames of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">J^1 \\mathcal{S}_n</code>, the Leray--Serre spectral sequence of the fibration <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{S}_{n+1} \\to \\mathcal{S}_n</code> determines the Betti numbers of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{S}_{n+1}</code>. The <a href=\"#def:quantum-characteristic-classes\" data-at=\"lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-construction\">quantum characteristic classes</a> obstruct the collapse of this spectral sequence, controlling the growth of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b_k(\\mathcal{S}_{n+1})</code> relative to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b_k(\\mathcal{S}_n)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/betti-numbers-brane.md","heading":"Remark","number":"6.8.1","page":"b/rem-betti-numbers-brane","qa":{"counts":{"pass":62,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":15,"unknown":0,"stale":0},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}}}
